                "url": "https://github.com/paperclipai/paperclip/pull/15804#discussion_r4241086370",
                "body": "<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\"></a> **Failed cleanup stays hidden**\n\n`release` silently drops every failed `disconnect` request. Closing the Computer tab can leave its viewer hold running until expiry without telling the user. This violates the UI directive: \u201cSurface failures clearly; do not silently ignore API errors.\u201d\n\nShow a cleanup warning through a toast or another surface that survives closing the panel. This repository requirement must be satisfied before merging.\n\n**Context Used:** AGENTS.md ([source](https://github.com/paperclipai/paperclip/blob/master/AGENTS.md))\n\n<details><summary>Prompt To Fix With AI</summary>\n\n`````markdown\nThis is a comment left during a code review.\nPath: ui/src/components/task-side-panel/TaskComputerPanel.tsx\nLine: 47-49\n\nComment:\n**Failed cleanup stays hidden**\n\n`release` silently drops every failed `disconnect` request. Closing the Computer tab can leave its viewer hold running until expiry without telling the user. This violates the UI directive: \u201cSurface failures clearly; do not silently ignore API errors.\u201d\n\nShow a cleanup warning through a toast or another surface that survives closing the panel. This repository requirement must be satisfied before merging.\n\n**Context Used:** AGENTS.md ([source](https://github.com/paperclipai/paperclip/blob/master/AGENTS.md))\n\n---\n\nFor each issue above, determine whether it is valid and should be fixed. If so, fix it directly.\n`````\n</details>",
